[b]A new update[/b] has arrived!
────────────────────────────────────────
[b]Version [2026.09.1][/b]:
[list]
    [*]Introduce an option to confirm the Delve Exit prompt automatically.
    [list]
        [*]It's [b][u]disabled[/u][/b] by default. It can be toggled in the addon options.
        [*]There is an additional toggle in the window displayed entering a Delve. It can be used to quickly toggle the option.
    [/list]
[/list]
[img]https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1218457/changelog/changelog_291a84e7-4023-4b2c-bcca-f37704d69065.png[/img]
[list]
    [*][b]Widget In Delves[/b]: Add a new option to change widget size.
    [*][b]QoL[/b]: Improve how the [b]Custom[/b] position of the [b]Widget In Delves[/b] is saved (thanks to `AndyMM22` for the contribution).
    [list]
        [*]Now, it should be persistent between characters and layouts and should not be reset after restart.
        [*]The widget is displayed opening the addon options outside of the Delves. So you can tweak its position any time.
        [*]There is also a button to reset the Custom position if the widget gets lost.
    [/list]
[/list]
[img]https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1218457/changelog/changelog_204a964a-ab90-4295-a14a-797275002342.png[/img]
[list]
    [*]Update localization.
[/list]
────────────────────────────────────────
